Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### OIDC 手动流程
GET http://127.0.0.1:9000/.well-known/openid-configuration
### 1
http://127.0.0.1:9000/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=creed-oidc-client&redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:9090/login/oauth2/code/creed-oidc&scope=openid%20profile%20api.read&state=STATE

### 2
POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic Y3JlZWQtb2lkYy1jbGllbnQ6b2lkYy1zZWNyZXQ=

grant_type=authorization_code&redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:9090/login/oauth2/code/creed-oidc&code=jzFspCfjRH4VOkvRTOgmhFFZoXpBh8s4gWSnNXz_ghP5F_LGLbr9X-EkKLNZ0mUk43rGE3k76kP8FXXUlZn_xE0USA74fZJmdVSsiyG0VYhJD1uDCOYdK4MPTOh3QIJ3

